{"reviewId": "386397050_89gdIed8Q", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "宏观对冲 = 看全世界大环境，哪边要涨买哪边，哪边要跌就做空/躲开，不单独死磕一只股票。\n普通散户：\n只买A股，赌股票涨，涨了赚，跌了亏，没得选。\n宏观对冲大佬（比如索罗斯）：\n1. 看美债收益率高不高\n2. 看康波周期走到哪一步\n3. 看全球经济会不会像次贷危机那样出事\n然后：\n• 股市要涨 → 买股票\n• 股市要跌 → 买黄金、做空股指、买美元\n• 大宗商品、汇率、债券、股票一起搭配", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "754-758", "abstract": "宏观对冲", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "386397050_89gdIed8Q", "userVid": 386397050, "topics": [], "createTime": 1779336743, "contextAbstract": "期，中国已经开始进入宏观对冲时代。但对中", "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 386397050, "name": "莓泥不行ʸᵃ", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0005-E2mU4xBLISZsua7EyhJMC10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "莓泥不行ʸᵃ", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-5", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作研习生", "levelIndex": 5}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 47, "likes": [{"userVid": 907712374, "name": "かまどねこ🐱", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/04LrpEqAf4uvTqicHibGZnfdBdYngmCylbheZzen0m5DtBchb2DYoJWq5autgcZamIKAbdmser65Q/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-50", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 50}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "全天候策略，挣得钱最终来自货币超发。就当前的趋势下，经济要增长只能涨价，推动因为生产力增长的技术还没有落地。也就是下一次康波周期的繁荣期，以人工智能为代表的技术应用大面积落地。在这个